    {
      "type": "text", "id": "t_legend", "x": 1815, "y": 1372, "width": 450, "height": 136,
      "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#333", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100,
      "text": "LEGEND\n■ Blue — External Data Sources\n■ Teal/Green — OCR Layer & Core Microservices (Atlas-EHR codebase)\n■ Gray — API Gateway / Infrastructure\n■ Orange — Apache Kafka Message Bus\n■ Purple — Data Persistence Layer\n■ Yellow — Output & Consumer Systems\n■ Pink — Cross-Cutting Concerns\n- - - Dashed arrow = cache read/write (bidirectional)",
      "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12, "containerId": null, "originalText": "LEGEND\n■ Blue — External Data Sources\n■ Teal/Green — OCR Layer & Core Microservices (Atlas-EHR codebase)\n■ Gray — API Gateway / Infrastructure\n■ Orange — Apache Kafka Message Bus\n■ Purple — Data Persistence Layer\n■ Yellow — Output & Consumer Systems\n■ Pink — Cross-Cutting Concerns\n- - - Dashed arrow = cache read/write (bidirectional)",
